  "correctValue": "243",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1c01ce1f-7cb5-4e98-8b34-b9d07d959d8b-f9b86a84-a45a-4c55-88cb-5ab93c0ad319-image.png\" style=\"width: 362px; height: 103px;\" /></p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> give <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c1056bf5-e839-4b3b-a4f4-7cd3394b41f2-image.png\" style=\"width: 124px; height: 65px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo></math> moles of&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/c1056bf5-e839-4b3b-a4f4-7cd3394b41f2-image.png\" style=\"width: 124px; height: 65px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>86</mn></mrow><mn>93</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mtext>acetanilide&#160;</mtext></msub><mn>135</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">W</mi><mtext>acelanilide&#160;</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>135</mn></mrow><mn>93</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p>But efficiency of reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>%</mo></math> only</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Mass of acetanilide produced<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>70</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>90</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>43</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>243</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>243</mn></math></p>",
